@host = https://localhost:7001

### Health check
GET {{host}}/health

### Register (stores the authentication cookie in supported clients)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Portfolio",
  "lastName": "User",
  "userName": "portfolio.user",
  "email": "portfolio@example.com",
  "phone": "+201000000000",
  "password": "Portfolio1!"
}

### List or search books
GET {{host}}/api/books?search=clean

### Create a book (requires the login cookie)
POST {{host}}/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Domain-Driven Design",
  "price": 450,
  "description": "A practical guide to modelling complex software domains.",
  "author": "Eric Evans",
  "isRead": false,
  "rate": 5,
  "genre": "Software Engineering",
  "publisherId": 1,
  "authorsId": [1]
}
